    <!-- About -->
    <string name="about_title">About Hikayat AlQuds</string>
    <string name="about_rule_title">The rule that shapes this app</string>
    <string name="about_rule_body">The generator never invents a historical fact. It simplifies, rearranges and summarises reviewed content, and nothing else. Where the records do not cover something, the app says so rather than filling the gap.</string>
    <string name="about_offline_title">Works with no connection</string>
    <string name="about_offline_body">The complete reviewed archive — every place, story, timeline, quiz and 34 photographs — ships inside the app and is read from the device. A connection adds newly contributed memories and server-side story generation; it is never needed to read.</string>
    <string name="about_photographs_title">Photographs</string>
    <string name="about_photographs_body">Every photograph is a real picture of the actual place, shown with its photographer and licence. A then-and-now comparison is only offered where the archive holds two photographs of the same subject.</string>
